# This file holds Operations Orders for B-Sharp Programming Language.
# Here, all expressions, terms, and factors are written with the 
# rules assigned to each.

EXPR    : TERM ((PLUS | MINUS) TERM) *
TERM    : FACTOR ((MUL | DIV) FACTOR) *
FACTOR  : INT | FLOAT